-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------

  Replay      every view of 524 sampled screen updates of one recording equal
              per pixel to a model of the original's renderer; the game's own
              RAM and registers equal at each; all 18 dissolve views

  Emulator    CSpect 4.5.9: loading screen, menu, walk to the castle (version
              1.0's build, which differs only in holding the loading screen)

  Coverage    one recording (5,233 updates); neither cheat played

  Hardware    ZX Spectrum Next (owner's): loaded from this patch through the
              loader's build screen and played; Original colours seen in
              version 1.0

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
